[{"title":"朝雨","author":"郑善夫","text":"若木光初判，玄云复积阴。\n撼江风色劲，洒壁雨声淫。\n泉室鲛人泣，天边越客吟。\n馀情何处诉，燕雀处堂深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19694,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"将旦","author":"郑善夫","text":"曙色浮东海，腾腾渐太清。\n明霞低水槛，宿雾迥江城。\n警柝已罢击，征人初启行。\n豺狼今挈领，岂是乏长缨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19695,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与方质父登于山","author":"郑善夫","text":"巾舄动高兴，江山入大观。\n烟霞几回首，天地一凭栏。\n晴日千村晚，长风五月寒。\n莫嫌踪迹远，石室在人间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19696,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨夜","author":"郑善夫","text":"萧萧风振屋，汎汎雨鸣楼。\n宿鸟惊巢堕，潜鲛出水游。\n客床沾处湿，病枕听来愁。\n颇羡清江上，风波不碍鸥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19697,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"地上","author":"郑善夫","text":"雨霁临池好，桥平纵步宜。\n湿泥勤燕子，新水乐鱼儿。\n病叶风多下，团萍夕更移。\n中吴消息恶，吟赏泪交垂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19698,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋暮","author":"郑善夫","text":"秋色去不反，客心悲奈何。\n病妨风土恶，愁感岁时过。\n弟妹流离甚，江湖丧乱多。\n沧洲十月雪，回首钓渔蓑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19699,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题南野旧居","author":"郑善夫","text":"南山百亩地，记得种瓜时。\n风日蜻蜓下，犁锄布谷知。\n辋川流水在，谷口主人非。\n独鹤青天外，空亭自落晖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19700,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湖上","author":"郑善夫","text":"爱此湖上雨，共君湖上游。\n乾坤双短鬓，江海一虚舟。\n烟景初相见，春光不可求。\n明朝下西崦，相望意悠悠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19701,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"参文殊禅道上得栖字","author":"郑善夫","text":"移舟泊浅渚，风日便轮蹄。\n不雨江声定，长阴野意齐。\n香厨钟后饭，田舍午时鸡。\n入山应未得，聊尔学禅栖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19702,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次刘德羲怀金山韵","author":"郑善夫","text":"记得金山顶，风烟八面开。\n乾坤留柱石，沧海失蓬莱。\n夜色京江水，春光般若台。\n兵尘兼病眼，长望几徘徊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19703,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重游大石次刘德羲韵二首 其一","author":"郑善夫","text":"病夫泉石性，山雨健来过。\n花濡回蛱蝶，松偃足藤萝。\n隔岁青春别，同群白发多。\n宦游殊慰此，高志未全讹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19704,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重游大石次刘德羲韵二首 其二","author":"郑善夫","text":"幽事住云泉，湖光远接连。\n寺钟山意动，松雨涧声悬。\n石壁开云窦，桃花隐洞天。\n中原尚多垒，此地合逃禅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19705,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望武夷时与黄元质同赋","author":"郑善夫","text":"客路未千里，名山已万重。\n歌传武夷曲，兴落幔亭峰。\n密竹幽幽鸟，深溪隐隐舂。\n黄生诗句好，吾得事游踪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19706,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有怀","author":"郑善夫","text":"独客路千里，美人天一方。\n连宵入我梦，今日写新章。\n白月犹故国，青山皆异乡。\n不堪秋信至，梧叶下沧浪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19707,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谒屏山书院","author":"郑善夫","text":"隐隐屏山顶，悠然见考亭。\n众星开分野，一水入沧溟。\n礼乐今为盛，门墙世必经。\n平生鸿鹄志，数问紫州城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19708,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谒考亭书院","author":"郑善夫","text":"西门犹阙里，平地见沧洲。\n谋道无虚日，寻源直到头。\n德言俱不朽，庙貌正须优。\n欲济波涛阔，临流重涩羞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19709,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送王崇贤","author":"郑善夫","text":"黑云天未厌，清江船不开。\n客情春草长，国事朔风来。\n叹世长卿枕，疑人郭隗台。\n看君回綵服，拜舞兴悠哉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19710,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠吾隐君兼怀惟可","author":"郑善夫","text":"谁言道学者，正印自文山。\n守黑惟空谷，潜身到大还。\n声名百世下，交谊九垓间。\n因尔怀君子，江湖好驻颜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19711,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"棠陵家观释宗林诗画戏为一偈嘲之","author":"郑善夫","text":"莲社柢能入，林公许径过。\n法衣乘獦獠，佛日动山河。\n五蕴元空寂，三车亦障魔。\n白牛载词藻，西去欲如何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19712,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬日对白菊","author":"郑善夫","text":"白菊尘埃里，翛然涅不缁。\n风霜忌太洁，桃李竞当时。\n水德元如此，花神祗自私。\n遐方对灯烛，聊副赏心期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19713,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀人","author":"郑善夫","text":"客思苦作恶，美人长别离。\n愁深九日菊，梦饱故山芝。\n劫火明天地，秋声入鼓鼙。\n销魂仍病骨，行止昩前知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19714,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题黄隐君水居二首 其一","author":"郑善夫","text":"人境不肯住，水居犹沧洲。\n青山如对隐，白发本无愁。\n春草诗魂合，秋风乐事求。\n鲈莼兴不浅，聊定此生谋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19715,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题黄隐君水居二首 其二","author":"郑善夫","text":"水居意自得，海鸥来不妨。\n老怀惟杖履，秋事在林塘。\n桂桨依渔父，菱歌出女郎。\n逃名非故尔，但恐失沧浪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19716,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"钓台","author":"郑善夫","text":"文叔为天子，先生顾钓矶。\n故人一夜话，星坐旧山归。\n严濑无今古，羊裘有是非。\n瓣香台下拜，素志尚依违。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19717,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得闽中消息","author":"郑善夫","text":"闽中久无雨，百谷尽枯燋。\n魃虐延诸郡，农工岂一朝。\n何时免冻馁，吾邑更征徭。\n避地翻愁思，馀生不自聊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19718,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对雪答太白山人","author":"郑善夫","text":"天地忽改色，六花风乱投。\n因之翠袖薄，加我草堂幽。\n照水梅自媚，衔泥燕有求。\n一杯思共尔，日暮问行舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19719,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭龚道","author":"郑善夫","text":"海内君知我，闽中我失君。\n云霄剑在壁，风雨榻扬尘。\n龙见悲吾道，乌飞念此身。\n艰危有壮志，南望重沾巾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19720,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"旅夕逢所亲述怀","author":"郑善夫","text":"乍见却悲欢，相询语夜阑。\n数年罢道路，诸弟泣饥寒。\n井灶还多故，亲朋有永叹。\n自怜飘泊甚，闻此屹忧端。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19721,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"下濑","author":"郑善夫","text":"回溪去似箭，乱石簇如鎗。\n下濑扶招急，凌湍荡桨忙。\n未妨临滟滪，翻喜得沧浪。\n范蠡扁舟外，风波更渺茫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19722,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠王双林游宦海门","author":"郑善夫","text":"振铎维扬去，堂斋俎豆幽。\n岂为苍水使，与度海门秋。\n三鳣随风至，群龙抱日游。\n山阳篴可听，展转忆良俦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19723,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送彭少参进万寿表","author":"郑善夫","text":"离声言可恶，子去似登仙。\n敬述诸侯职，欢呼圣主年。\n青云缠礼服，白浪静楼船。\n锡尔天闲马，黄金台下传。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19724,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答方思道富阳见寄","author":"郑善夫","text":"浙水浩天涯，吴门意已乖。\n三年方数字，半世渺孤怀。\n萍梗犹能合，风尘未见偕。\n富春霜雪里，却忆凤喈喈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19725,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"木假山","author":"郑善夫","text":"已幸脱煨烬，漂零故不辞。\n肌肤浑尽剥，丰骨坐称奇。\n㟝嵝羞相学，云霞信所为。\n从兹别林薮，深结主人知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19726,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿七里潭","author":"郑善夫","text":"无数滩皆恶，安恬独此潭。\n溯流心共澹，汲古味能甘。\n永夜鱼龙定，空山鬼魅谈。\n高秋进萧䬃，行役遍东南。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19727,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小野堂对菊","author":"郑善夫","text":"小野堂前菊，相逢满意花。\n诸君抱冰雪，散地有烟霞。\n傍月神犹整，当歌影故斜。\n异时追此夕，萧瑟向瑶华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19728,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答曹仲礼见赠","author":"郑善夫","text":"未暇曹刘体，逍遥了岁年。\n聊应备土缶，岂敢冒朱弦。\n情性人俱得，咸英世不传。\n从兹习喑哑，作用在忘筌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19729,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题程时言侍御和溪谱","author":"郑善夫","text":"君家好乔木，远影郁婆娑。\n桂树青霄上，桃花骇浪多。\n高峰回日月，大地涌星河。\n近阅篁墩谱，燕山岂啻过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19730,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题田给事一竹轩","author":"郑善夫","text":"羡尔云霄势，泠然冰玉姿。\n空斋寄森爽，独立出喧卑。\n尚阻潇湘对，终收淇澳诗。\n幔亭霜雪盛，应长凤凰枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19731,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病居读顾与新诗","author":"郑善夫","text":"伏枕殊方客，秋风岁载阴。\n鍊形功不就，抵病意何深。\n稍出词章网，翻为著作淫。\n头风顿觉愈，吾只爱陈琳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19732,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"林沧洲下第赴荆门","author":"郑善夫","text":"怜君不得意，归鬓忽成丝。\n更下荆门棹，还闻巫峡悲。\n礼严徐孺榻，义重象山祠。\n应念投竿客，终为帝者师。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19733,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"惠山酌第二泉","author":"郑善夫","text":"惠山好泉品，清切锡城隅。\n松石阴堪结，莲蓉翠不孤。\n寺虚流夜气，沙润长秋菰。\n笑挈二三子，朔风近舞雩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19734,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忆思道","author":"郑善夫","text":"近忆棠陵子，还朝定此时。\n肯为黄歇客，兴在白云司。\n意气吾能共，江山君最奇。\n夔龙格心事，天意要人为。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19735,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读备遗录","author":"郑善夫","text":"神尧无信史，谁纪革除年。\n龙虎风云上，山河涕泪边。\n夷齐偏守死，王魏总知权。\n三复春秋传，微词今不传。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19736,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望雁宕","author":"郑善夫","text":"雁宕青到眼，天南秋复凉。\n宁辞北山屐，来傍水仙王。\n越鸟随风化，瓯童触雾黄。\n未须悲道路，前是武陵乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19737,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再哭近夫","author":"郑善夫","text":"近夫吾益友，失汝自吴江。\n末世英雄短，平生涕泪双。\n参乎真悟道，回也未为邦。\n不见牛刀试，青田俗尽庞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19738,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"刘实夫静观楼","author":"郑善夫","text":"刘子吾邦秀，高楼元气边。\n定心还到眼，慧日正行天。\n风物无拘碍，江山且岁年。\n平生腾踏志，终要九潘渊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19739,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白将军","author":"郑善夫","text":"将军出武威，仗剑镇东陲。\n气压风云阵，秋生熊虎姿。\n长挥白羽扇，岂羡锐头儿。\n数载伤多垒，云台及盛时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19740,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咄咄","author":"郑善夫","text":"咄咄长廊下，倡歌谁为闻。\n世人皆梦寐，之子独风云。\n土净菩提路，天垂星斗文。\n犹存顶神咒，至语未曾分。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19741,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠欧阳崇道","author":"郑善夫","text":"使君廊庙器，秪惜颖川名。\n世事忧无尽，吾邦兆已行。\n况逢王者作，要使海波平。\n倘及莘中隐，深耕自性情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19742,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭仲默","author":"郑善夫","text":"去年孙复死，今复哭何休。\n霄汉冥交尽，嵩邙正气收。\n操戈吾岂敢，怀宝尔终投。\n秪益文章价，年年照斗牛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19743,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谒紫阳精舍","author":"郑善夫","text":"山水奇如此，乾坤气所储。\n昔贤遗笋蜕，异代俨门庐。\n岁晏芝苓长，天高风露馀。\n蹉跎逐簪笏，尚愧紫阳居。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19744,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三陟","author":"郑善夫","text":"怜君忧思剧，三上白云山。\n风树吹无尽，鸰原望不还。\n堂阶抱古恨，松柏变秋颜。\n莫以歌终曲，人生涕泪繁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19745,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日怀京华诸友","author":"郑善夫","text":"闻说神龙起，群贤一网提。\n中原刑白马，南国且黄鹂。\n夜楫谁同击，春江他自迷。\n无能逐公子，锡宴上林西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19746,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄容台旧僚友","author":"郑善夫","text":"上德符元命，南宫列隽才。\n周王郊祀毕，汉日辟雍开。\n法驾新承幸，芝坛定数陪。\n百年大礼乐，述作意悠哉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19747,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日寄赤城诸友","author":"郑善夫","text":"几载不相见，天台叶又飞。\n行藏归一是，尧桀自相非。\n江海完吾志，星霜变客衣。\n风期与云会，莫遣道心微。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19748,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏雨","author":"郑善夫","text":"南天春苦旱，咎在岁星沉。\n四月禾苗歇，三农雨望深。\n油云肤寸合，一似雨黄金。\n君王社稷主，要识上天心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19749,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"张起溟得子","author":"郑善夫","text":"闻得充闾庆，青天眼不孤。\n君犹倚桐树，此是凤凰雏。\n昔日三苏出，眉山万木枯。\n乡书日暮至，定报有嘉符。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19750,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元夕登鳌峰绝顶","author":"郑善夫","text":"共尔寻芳酌，复从鳌顶行。\n风烟有元夕，星汉下孤城。\n石祖他年梦，山公一笑迎。\n高歌倚梅树，瞻注有馀情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19751,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答陈鉴","author":"郑善夫","text":"武原陈仲举，惠我古苔篇。\n读罢生阴籁，知君玄又玄。\n高贤惠远社，归客洞庭船。\n何日寻芳约，蓬山种玉田。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19752,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"除夕二首 其一","author":"郑善夫","text":"忽忽屠苏夕，匆匆吴楚春。\n岁华无奈守，酒盏可怜频。\n世短聊看斗，时艰复问津。\n剑文差不翳，犹得慰情亲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19753,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"除夕二首 其二","author":"郑善夫","text":"丧乱满天地，风烟无古今。\n吴门又除夕，粤客未投簪。\n灯晕他年梦，椒花故国心。\n翻怜痴儿女，嬉笑夜堂深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19754,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋月","author":"郑善夫","text":"初昏见秋月，耿耿即西倾。\n河汉留光景，关山入杳冥。\n众星森北向，一鸟浩南征。\n莫遣微云起，渠能秽太清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19755,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吕梁","author":"郑善夫","text":"数载河为患，怅然思禹功。\n源从西极下，水到吕梁雄。\n天堑长淮北，地维沧海东。\n应悲箜篌曲，宛转意何穷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19756,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王南渠隐居","author":"郑善夫","text":"冠山龙卧处，流水近沧洲。\n形胜东南地，堂斋烟雨秋。\n谏书存事业，逐客且林丘。\n只看桐溪上，星文动斗牛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19757,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"大田篇","author":"郑善夫","text":"君王提一旅，礼法用三驱。\n木落鸿能矫，天寒虎在嵎。\n风尘收猛士，骑射局文儒。\n锐首谁家子，人间大丈夫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19758,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得友人书","author":"郑善夫","text":"每逢闽地客，数问尔沧洲。\n摇落意如此，烟波去无繇。\n传楫还长击，高柴未损忧。\n因风寄幽独，蚤晚大刀头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19759,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再送李曲江","author":"郑善夫","text":"曲江山水县，暇日好弹琴。\n要将流水意，遍作颖川唫。\n王风周末异，瘴色日南深。\n更点分明处，县知令尹心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19760,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀思道","author":"郑善夫","text":"闻君留阙里，勾当未曾还。\n五月过泗水，何时登太山。\n道存夫子室，礼接鲁生颜。\n星驾飘飘去，云天迥莫扳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19761,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄小野","author":"郑善夫","text":"倪侯隐南国，食禄二千钟。\n谁识神仙骨，长栖富贵丛。\n梅花行岭外，雁字过蛮中。\n何日飞寻女，而将黄鹤同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19762,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"剑州","author":"郑善夫","text":"溪声下黯淡，山意会延平。\n激漩当天险，横霄极地形。\n黄堂严上界，廛舍倚高城。\n龙剑真能合，虹桥本易成。\n茶菰流土物，粳秫得人生。\n李子濂伊嫡，刘滋卓鲁勍。\n士多通古学，民不废春耕。\n何处深传檄，兹邦乃苦兵。\n方将采竹箭，奚暇糁藜羹。\n正赖贤官府，艰虞系物情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":19763,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]